собность вручную или если расстояние до цели окажется слишком большим. Если противник заденет связь, его скорость передвижения будет уменьшена.","desc_en":"Tethers Io to an allied unit, granting bonus movement speed to both. When Io restores health or mana, the tethered unit gains a portion of that amount. The tether breaks when the allied unit moves too far away, or Io cancels the tether. Tether slows enemies touching it.","notes_ru":["Если вы попытаетесь связаться с союзником на расстоянии в 700 единиц или больше, вас притянет к нему на расстояние в 300.","Связанный с вами союзник быстрее восстанавливает здоровье и ману, даже если у вас полное здоровье.","Скорость передвижения героя приравнивается к скорости того, с кем он связан."],"notes_en":["If you try to tether a unit that is 700 distance or further away from Io, Io will latch on and pull itself closer to the tethered unit (to a distance of 300).","The tethered unit will heal faster and will heal even if Io is at full health.","Io's movement speed matches the tethered unit's."],"specials":[{"key":"radius","system":false,"heading_ru":"МАКС. РАССТОЯНИЕ СВЯЗКИ:","heading_en":"MAX TETHER DISTANCE:","values":[1000.0],"percent":false},{"key":"movespeed","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДОП. СКОРОСТЬ ПЕРЕДВИЖЕНИЯ:","heading_en":"MOVEMENT SPEED BONUS:","values":[6.0,8.0,10.0,12.0],"percent":true,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_wisp_3","level":15,"op":"add","value":5,"values_with":[11.0,13.0,15.0,17.0]}]},{"key":"latch_distance","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[700.0],"percent":false},{"key":"latch_speed","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[1000.0],"percent":false},{"key":"tether_heal_amp","system":false,"heading_ru":"ПЕРЕДАВАЕМЫЕ ЗДОРОВЬЕ/МАНА:","heading_en":"HP/MANA TRANSFER:","values":[55.0,75.0,95.0,115.0],"percent":true},{"key":"tether_mana_amp","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[55.0,75.0,95.0,115.0],"percent":false},{"key":"slow","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЗАМЕДЛЕНИЕ ПЕРЕДВИЖЕНИЯ/АТАКИ ВРАГА:","heading_en":"ENEMY MOVE/ATTACK SLOW:","values":[15.0,30.0,45.0,60.0],"percent":true},{"key":"slow_duration","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.2],"percent":false},{"key":"damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН В СЕКУНДУ:","heading_en":"DAMAGE PER SECOND:","values":[0.0],"percent":false,"values_shard":[120.0]},{"key":"damage_to_heal","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.0],"percent":false,"values_shard":[50.0]},{"key":"tick_rate","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.5],"percent":false},{"key":"tether_attack_damage_pct","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_wisp_4","level":25,"op":"set","value":50}]},{"key":"AbilityCastRange","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[1600.0],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityManaCost","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[40.0],"percent":false},{"key":"AbilityCooldown","system":true,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[12.0],"percent":false}],"shard":{"text_ru":"Связь наносит урон задетым противникам и излечивает владельца на 50% от этого урона.","text_en":"Tether damages enemies touching it. Io is healed for 50% of the damage done.","changes":[{"key":"damage","heading_ru":"УРОН В СЕКУНДУ:","from":[0.0],"to":[120.0]},{"key":"damage_to_heal","heading_ru":null,"from":[0.0],"to":[50.0]}]},"scepter":null},{"key":"wisp_spirits","id":5486,"hero":"wisp","name_ru":"Spirits","name_en":"Spirits","kind":"basic","innate":false,"granted_by_scepter":false,"granted_by_shard":false,"max_level":4,"behavior":["no_target","immediate"],"behavior_ru":["без цели","мгновенная"],"target_team":[],"target_type":[],"target_flags":[],"damage_type":"magical","bkb_pierce":false,"immunity_code":4,"immunity":"enemies_no","dispellable":"no","cooldown":[15.0],"mana_cost":[90.0,100.0,110.0,120.0],"health_cost":[],"gold_cost":[],"cast_range":[],"cast_point":[],"channel_time":[],"duration":[15.0],"desc_ru":"Призывает пять духов, которые кружатся вокруг героя. При столкновении с вражеским героем дух взрывается, нанося урон всем существам в области вокруг взрыва. При столкновении с крипом дух наносит немного урона, но не взрывается. По окончании действия способности взрываются все оставшиеся духи.","desc_en":"Summon five particle spirits that dance in a circle around Io. If a particle collides with an enemy hero, it explodes, damaging all enemy units in an area around it. Creeps take minor damage from touching a particle spirit, but do not cause them to explode. When its duration ends, any remaining Spirits explode.","notes_ru":["Призвав духов, герой может приблизить или отдалить их."],"notes_en":["After summoning, Io can call the spirits in and out."],"specials":[{"key":"creep_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН ПО КРИПАМ:","heading_en":"CREEP DAMAGE:","values":[12.0,18.0,24.0,30.0],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_wisp","level":15,"op":"percent_increase","value":40,"values_with":[16.8,25.2,33.6,42.0]}]},{"key":"hero_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"УРОН ПО ГЕРОЯМ:","heading_en":"HERO DAMAGE:","values":[30.0,50.0,70.0,90.0],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_wisp","level":15,"op":"percent_increase","value":40,"values_with":[42.0,70.0,98.0,126.0]}]},{"key":"revolution_time","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[5.0],"percent":false},{"key":"min_range","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[200.0],"percent":false},{"key":"default_radius","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[425.0],"percent":false},{"key":"max_range","system":false,"heading_ru":"РАДИУС КОЛЕБАНИЙ:","heading_en":"OSCILLATION RADIUS:","values":[650.0],"percent":false},{"key":"hero_hit_radius","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[110.0],"perc